IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P1-annex-i`

-- P1-tests-annex-i: tests for Annex I. Expected values come from the text: the table rows are the Annex's own words (lines 1677 to 1698 of the
-- consolidated text, line 2282 of the text as enacted for item 1), the sections are the Annex's own headings, and the two sides of 27 July 2026
-- (the Omnibus deleted item 1 and added item 21; the Regulation exists from 1 August 2024) are written from Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 Article 1 point (41).

§ `Each row of the table has the Annex's words`

-- item 1 (line 2282 of the text as enacted)
