§ `The two tables: item 1 deleted and item 21 added by the Omnibus`

-- As enacted: 20 items (1 to 20). As amended: 20 items (2 to 21). Section A has items 1 to 12 as enacted, items 2 to 12 as amended.
#ASSERT count `Annex I as enacted the entries` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT count `Annex I as amended the entries` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `Annex I as enacted the entry of the item` `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` EQUALS JUST `Annex I item 1 entry`
-- VERSION as amended: item 1 is deleted (the consolidated text shows only the marker and a dash line).
#ASSERT `Annex I as amended the entry of the item` `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` EQUALS NOTHING
-- VERSION as enacted: item 21 does not exist.
#ASSERT `Annex I as enacted the entry of the item` `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex I as amended the entry of the item` `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` EQUALS JUST `Annex I item 21 entry`
-- The case outside the list has no entry in either text.
#ASSERT `Annex I as enacted the entry of the item` `Annex I no listed legislation` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex I as amended the entry of the item` `Annex I no listed legislation` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex I the number of the item` `Annex I no listed legislation` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Annex I the number of the item` `Annex I item 14 Regulation (EU) No 168/2013` EQUALS 14

§ `The section of an item on the date asked (Regulation in force from 1 August 2024; Omnibus text from 27 July 2026)`

-- Before the Regulation exists: nothing to say (NOTHING-kind, silent).
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 31 7 2024) `Annex I item 2 Directive 2009/48/EC` EQUALS NOTHING
-- On 1 August 2024 the Regulation is in force; item 2 is in Section A, item 13 in Section B (the Annex's own headings).
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 2 Directive 2009/48/EC` EQUALS JUST `Annex I Section A`
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 13 Regulation (EC) No 300/2008` EQUALS JUST `Annex I Section B`
-- Item 1 (machinery directive): Section A until 26 July 2026, gone from 27 July 2026.
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` EQUALS JUST `Annex I Section A`
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Item 21 (machinery regulation): not there until 26 July 2026, Section B from 27 July 2026.
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` EQUALS JUST `Annex I Section B`
-- An item the Omnibus did not touch reads the same on both sides.
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` EQUALS JUST `Annex I Section A`
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` EQUALS JUST `Annex I Section A`
#ASSERT `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I no listed legislation` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Is the legislation listed in Section A, in Section B, in either`

-- args: date asked, item, the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists (only item 20 limits it)
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 14 Regulation (EU) No 168/2013` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 14 Regulation (EU) No 168/2013` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Before the Regulation enters into force the Annex does not exist: NOTHING, never JUST FALSE.
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` (Date 31 7 2024) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 31 7 2024) `Annex I item 14 Regulation (EU) No 168/2013` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 31 7 2024) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Item 1: listed (Section A) on 26 July 2026, not listed from 27 July 2026; item 21 the other way round, in Section B.
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 1 Directive 2006/42/EC` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 27 7 2026) `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 26 7 2026) `Annex I item 21 Regulation (EU) 2023/1230` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Either section: a Section A act and a Section B act are both listed in Annex I.
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 11 Regulation (EU) 2017/745` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 1 8 2024) `Annex I item 18 Regulation (EU) 2018/858` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Item 20 is listed only in so far as the product is within the unmanned-aircraft part: inside and outside the limit.
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The fact about the limit is ignored by every other item (item 19, Section B).
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I item 19 Regulation (EU) 2019/2144` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The case outside the list: not listed once the Regulation exists (FALSE-kind: Article 6(1) hands the class to the list).
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I no listed legislation` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I no listed legislation` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` (Date 1 8 2025) `Annex I no listed legislation` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
